## How This Works
This is a Daisy Search investigation directory. You have access to:
- **daisy-search MCP server** — OSINT research tools (search, fetch, extract, facts, graph)
- **claude-in-chrome** — Chrome browser automation using your existing logged-in sessions (primary for auth-walled sites)
- **tethernet** — browser automation with network capture (for SPA/XHR interception)
- **axmcp** — Safari/macOS accessibility automation (AppleScript + AX tools)

The full research methodology is loaded as an MCP resource at `daisy://methodology`.
Read it at the start of every session if you haven't already.

